# List files or directories below to ignore them when running force:source:push, force:source:pull, and force:source:status
# More information: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_exclude_source.htm
#

# Standard metadata
package.xml
**/appMenus/**
**/appSwitcher/**
**/objectTranslations/**
**/profiles/**
**/settings/**

# LWC configuration files
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# LWC Jest
**/__tests__/**

node_modules/
.DS_Store

# Angular Recipes is in preview and not yet part of the standard deploy. It is
# excluded here on purpose so `sf project deploy start` ships React Recipes only.
# To try Angular Recipes in an org, remove (or comment out) the line below, then
# deploy — see force-app/main/angular-recipes/README.md. Deleting this line is the
# single switch that ships Angular Recipes when it graduates from preview.
force-app/main/angular-recipes/**